  "text": "**Alex:** So, have you seen the new art exhibit downtown?  \n**Jamie:** No, I haven\u2019t. Is it worth the time?  \n**Alex:** Definitely. The abstract piece at the end\u2014it\u2019s wild.  \n**Jamie:** Abstract? I thought it was more... realistic.  \n**Alex:** Wait, you\u2019ve seen it?  \n**Jamie:** No, I just heard the description. I\u2019m not sure I\u2019m into that kind of thing.  \n**Alex:** It\u2019s not for everyone. But the lighting in the room changes, so it\u2019s like the art *responds* to you.  \n**Jamie:** That sounds intense.  \n**Alex:** Yeah, it\u2019s kind of overwhelming at first. But once you get used to it, it\u2019s... fascinating.  \n**Jamie:** I might have to check it out then.  \n**Alex:** You should. I\u2019ll tag you on Instagram later.  \n**Jamie:** Sure. But only if you promise not to spoil the experience.  \n**Alex:** Deal. No spoilers.  \n**Jamie:** Thanks. I\u2019ll take that as a challenge.  \n**Alex:** Fair enough. See you later?  \n**Jamie:** Yeah, later.",
